WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.110
Here you go, Papa.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:06.930
Thank you, Mama.

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:11.950
Mom! I told you to take out the same pair of socks as Onii-chan’s.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.860
Oh, did you say that?

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.330
I’m having breakfast with <i>the</i> Irie-kun.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.290
It’s so strange.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:27.580
The Irie-kun I once loved is having nattou and miso soup.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.050
This is really something else!

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.260
So, how was it, Kotoko-chan?

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.150
Did you sleep well last night?

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.200
Yes.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.110
Ai-chan is still sleeping, isn’t he?

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:40.570
Sorry about that.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:43.680
Not at all. He’s a chef after all.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.270
I know he works late into the night.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.590
He must be tired from all
that’s happened too.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:51.280
That’s right. A lot did happen.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:52.610
I don’t want it.

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:59.450
My new house collapsed from a level-2 earthquake due to faulty construction.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:04.560
So, we’ll be living in my Dad’s friend’s house for a while.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:05.870
And over there...

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.380
I’m the eldest son, Naoki.
Nice to meet you.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:13.350
A lot sure did happen.

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:14.840
Thanks for the meal.

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:21.460
Hey, Yuuki! You still have time left, so finish all your food!

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:24.330
Kotoko-chan, please go together
with Onii-chan.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:25.520
Okay.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:00.540
Let me go! I wanna go too!

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:02.270
We’re going now.

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:06.100
Onii-chan, make sure Kotoko-chan knows the route to the train station, okay?

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:07.200
I wanna go too!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.290
Dangerous Cohabitation

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.540
No, you’ll be intruding.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:11.550
Dangerous Cohabitation

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.000
This is so awkward.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:25.160
If I had known that this would happen, I wouldn’t have given him the letter.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.160
Hey.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.480
Yes?

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:31.720
Don’t tell anyone
that we’re living together.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:35.420
And of course, don’t talk to me
at school either.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.200
What the hell was that!?

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.410
We apologize for the crowded trains.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.080
Unbelievable, I’ve never seen such a rush hour crowd before.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:49.220
Next stop, Shoudou.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.320
My bag is so far away.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:55.440
And on top of that, it’s hard to breathe...

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:58.420
Irie-kun looks so calm.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:01.580
The doors will be opening from the left.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:10.440
Hey! Oh, no! My bag! Excuse me! Hey, wait!

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:16.570
The doors are now closing. Please be careful.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.020
I’m getting on!

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:23.550
Irie-kun!

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:29.580
Wait!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.580
Miss, no rushing please!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.580
Irie-kun?

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.830
I don’t believe it.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:45.490
Please wait behind the white line.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:56.000
I made it on time...

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.900
Hey!

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:01.400
I told you not to talk to me.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:08.080
I was about to board, so couldn’t you have held the door for me... at the very least?

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:12.460
I hate absent-minded girls even more than stupid ones.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:21.650
Ice...

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:26.700
Ice runs through his veins!

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:33.200
Gah, I hate mid-terms.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.930
I’m giving up this time too.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.440
I’m in trouble if I fail again.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:42.000
Kotoko, you seem rather spirited.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.320
I’m gonna do it this time.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.240
I’m going to beat Irie Naoki!

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.440
That’s a really funny one!

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:57.720
Oh, please, Kotoko! The Gods will get angry even if it was a joke.

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:58.910
I’m serious.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.010
Hey, are you all right?

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.330
You’re acting weird!

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:06.110
You know, you’re up against not only the school’s number one, but the number one in Tokyo!

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.620
Actually, he might even be Japan’s number one genius!

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:09.970
Enough!

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.450
In other words, I’m feeling that level of determination.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:15.600
I’m going to get on the notice board!

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.190
Only the top fifty students are listed. Do you understand the situation?

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:24.940
Never in history has there been an F-Class student in the top fifty!

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.990
I’ll change history then!

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:30.950
I know I have no chance of beating him.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.100
But, at the very least, I’ll get my name
on the same board as him.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.430
Oh, no...

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:42.350
I don’t get it at all.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.630
Where should I start from?

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.550
I don’t even know what I don’t understand!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.800
Yes?

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.550
Kotoko-chan, you’re awake?
I brought you a snack.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:55.470
Sorry for the trouble, Oba-sama.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:58.140
It’s really yummy!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:01.040
Isn’t this great?

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:03.770
I really feel like a mother now.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:07.280
Onii-chan doesn’t study at all.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:10.980
So, I can’t even make a snack for him like this.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:13.240
He doesn’t study?!

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.810
But, Irie-kun is the top student in school!

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.910
Yeah. It’s pretty incredible,
don’t you think?

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.830
He’s rather unadorable like that.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.290
Then, what’s he doing now?

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.880
He’s fast asleep.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:29.870
He really is a genius!

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:33.040
You should ask him to teach you the parts you don’t understand.

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.950
I wish I could.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.910
Say, would you like to take a short break?

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.780
I’ll show you something really interesting.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:42.150
Ah, is that Irie-kun’s?

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:44.270
I’ve always wanted to show this to someone.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.580
Irie-kun when he was young...

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:47.270
Huh?

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.960
She’s so cute!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:55.100
Right?

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:58.660
That’s Onii-chan.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.670
But, it really does look like...

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:05.680
I really wanted a girl.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:08.730
I was so sure that I would
give birth to a girl.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:11.370
So, all I bought were girl’s clothes.

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:15.390
I was rather shocked when
Onii-chan was born.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.070
I didn’t want to buy new clothes.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:21.850
So, I dressed him up in girls’ clothing until he was old enough to protest.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:26.740
He’s extremely bitter about this.

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:30.610
I wonder if this is the reason behind his cold attitude.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.210
Yuuki doesn’t know about this either.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:35.840
So, please keep this a secret.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:36.620
Of course!

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:39.220
That Irie-kun has...

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:44.830
Hey, Kotoko. Where are you staying now by the way?

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:48.340
Ah, at my Dad’s friend’s place.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.530
Which area?

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:52.170
Around Setagaya, I suppose.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:55.260
You don’t say! That’s nice.
Where in Setagaya?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.890
I’m not really sure.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.690
I guess I have to keep it secret.

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:01.270
Aihara-san.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.600
Bring your bag and come with me.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:10.720
It seems that my mother
put the wrong ones in.

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.860
I was wondering why mine was so large.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.420
I think they exchanged something.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.480
I can’t hear what they’re saying.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:22.800
Don’t tell me that he changed his mind and now wants to ask Kotoko out?

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:25.360
No way! That would be incredible though!

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:28.080
It’s already too late for you to fall for her, dumbass!

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:33.490
Sheesh, mix-ups happen because we go to the same school.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:36.980
That’s right.

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:41.510
You might even get the wrong uniform and wear mine instead, Irie-kun.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:45.550
Why would I wear yours mistakenly?

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.780
Well, that’s because...

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.740
...it seems like you wore skirts when you were young.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.320
You’re so adorable, Irie-kun!

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:58.540
What’s happening?!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:00.640
That know-it-all probably got rejected instead this time!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.600
Serves you right!

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:05.380
Where did you dig that out from?!

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.840
Your mother gave me one.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:08.610
Give it back!

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:09.580
No!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.620
What did you say?

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:15.000
Because, you keep bullying me all the time.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.500
Isn’t it okay once in a while?

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.840
When did I ever bully you?!

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.690
Even geniuses have their weaknesses.

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:21.500
I said, give it back!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.980
I’ll give it back, but on one condition.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:25.330
Condition?

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:29.810
The mid-terms are coming up in two weeks. Help tutor me.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.360
Me? Be your...?

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:37.560
Correct. I’ll return it if you can help get me into the top fifty. Deal?

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.780
I refuse! It’s obviously impossible!

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:41.570
Oh, really?

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:45.720
Then, I’ll just mass-mail this photo to all the students in school.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.680
Fine then!

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.600
Really? Hooray!

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:52.650
But, I can’t promise anything.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:58.980
The top fifty have been filled mostly by those from Class A and B each and every time.

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:03.050
It would require divine intervention for someone from Class F like you to be able to get in.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.680
I think you’re right...

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.700
Tonight then.

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:13.190
Kotoko!

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.620
What were you talking about?

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:19.770
You rejected him right?
Please tell me that you rejected him!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.570
It wasn’t about that!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.870
Divine intervention, huh?

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.580
I’ll show you!

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:39.130
Onii-chan, help me study too!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:42.100
Don’t you get the best grades even without my help?

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:48.970
I’m getting nervous now that we’re alone together.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:53.620
Say, I heard that you never study.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.440
How are you able to do
so well on your tests?

00:11:55.440 --> 00:12:00.600
Isn’t it normal to remember after hearing or reading something once?

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:03.110
In what country is that normal?

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:05.450
You should be able to get 80 points if you can do these.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.130
Looks like some secret code.

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:19.150
Still can’t solve it?

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:19.800
Wait.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:23.070
I got it wrong, didn’t I?

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:25.170
How did it turn out like this?

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:26.540
Where’s the formula?

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:28.810
Formula? What was it again?

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:31.870
What were you hearing in class?!

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:33.810
I’d like to see what’s inside your head!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.560
We’ll start from the basics.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.250
Listen carefully!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:39.340
Yes!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:45.040
X equals 72?

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.090
Correct.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.590
Hooray!

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:49.780
There are still nine questions left.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.460
Sorry for disturbing you two.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.390
What are you doing?

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:59.770
But, you and Kotoko-chan
look so good together.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.570
You two should get married.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.380
What are you thinking? That’s ridiculous!

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:09.200
Well, here’s your snack. Bye.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.170
Let’s continue.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.760
Okay.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.970
You’ve looked sleepy lately, Kotoko.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.840
Yeah, I’ve been studying.

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:26.890
Come on, tell us the truth, Kotoko.

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:29.900
You’re being worked to the bone in your new home, aren’t you?

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:32.750
You say that you’re studying to keep us from worrying.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:37.190
I know that you’re getting bullied.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:40.130
I’ll go to that house...

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.840
Eh? Kotoko?

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.390
She said that she’s going to the library before heading home.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:50.680
It says, “When was I an elementary school student”?

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:56.150
Oh, god. Even the Japanese
doesn’t make sense.

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.160
This is middle school stuff.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.900
Hey, this one here...

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:14.620
He really does look cool when I look at him like this.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:20.680
The Irie-kun I admired.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.550
Pardon me. I brought a snack.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.930
What a problem we have here.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.930
Good luck on your tests.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.730
This is a good luck charm.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.010
Thanks!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.830
Don’t open it before the results.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:44.940
Sheesh, it’s not an entrance exam.
Okay.

00:14:58.740 --> 00:14:59.790
Hey!

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.970
Please don’t rush on board.

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:10.910
I’d like to thank him.
At least one word.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.890
But, he’ll probably get angry if I talk to him in school.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.140
He’s bound to ignore me too anyway.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.640
Oh, no! Gotta get to class!

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.140
Thanks.

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.350
Good luck.

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:31.240
Then, please begin.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.620
These questions...

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:42.580
It’s exactly the same as the questions Irie-kun made for me!

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:48.420
I don’t quite believe it,
but I know the answers!

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:56.900
Time’s up!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.650
Kotoko, how was it?

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:07.070
I think, I knew how to do it.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.730
Why do you look so relaxed?

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:12.450
You’ll embarrass yourself later.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:15.120
Come on, let’s go have some
fun today, Kotoko.

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.510
Wait, Kin-chan.

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:19.700
I won’t let you go today no matter
what you say.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:23.750
Hey, that girl; wasn’t she the one who confessed to you?

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:27.120
So, she’s already together
with that Kansai guy.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:28.770
It’s none of our business.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:39.180
Excuse me please.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:45.400
Number one is... Irie-kun got...

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:49.960
Thank goodness.

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:53.110
I’m not on the board, am I?

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:58.760
What’s up? You never look at the results.

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:03.210
Hey, number one is on that end.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:04.780
This side is...

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.170
Hey, Irie!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:19.600
Congrats on getting first.
Perfect score too.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:24.470
Of course. That’s the first time I’ve ever studied so much.

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:26.350
And yourself. You did it too.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.710
You haven’t seen it?

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:33.190
Fiftieth?

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.780
Irie-kun! I got fiftieth!

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:41.740
Thank you, I’m so happy! Thank you!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:42.750
Not that.

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:46.500
Return me the thing you promised.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.080
Oh, that’s right.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.130
Here.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.500
Don’t take it out in the open like that!

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:57.760
Also, I’ve said it many times, but please refrain from talking to me in school.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.900
Thank you, Irie-kun!

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.020
Just after I told her.

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:11.730
He’s top and I’m bottom.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:14.970
But still, I’m on the same piece of paper as Irie-kun.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.490
Hey, Miss Number Fifty.

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:23.270
Don’t you feel like the Irie of Class F?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.500
Not quite.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.200
Hey, you dropped something, Kotoko.

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:32.020
This is...

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.750
This is a good luck charm.

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:36.030
Thanks.

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:38.310
Don’t open it before the results.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:39.970
I forgot about this.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.230
What’s that?

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:45.820
It’s a good luck charm which helped me get into the top fifty.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.400
Don’t you want to share it with us?

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.120
What the hell is this?!

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.540
Kin-san, hang in there, man!

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:56.110
Oh, no. The shock was too much!
Water, water!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.830
Hey, Kotoko! What is this about?!

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.290
Umm... well...

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:04.340
Why are you and Irie-kun sleeping together so happily?

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:06.410
Forgive me!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:09.370
Your parents are close friends?

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:13.820
So, you had Irie tutor you
for the tests this time?

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:15.050
Yeah.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:20.060
So that explains you being in the top fifty. He really is a genius.

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:21.430
That’s a really harsh way to put it.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:24.440
But, don’t they look really close
in these photos?

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:29.620
With you living under the same roof, has Irie’s heart, or maybe his preferences changed too?

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:31.850
Don’t be stupid!

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.020
That’s right!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:36.840
Even at home, he totally ignores me.

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.230
He hates me.

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:39.990
Kotoko...

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.490
Poor thing.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:42.950
That’s horrible.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:47.000
But, I don’t care about that cold-hearted guy. I’m fine.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:49.080
Cold-hearted?

00:19:58.710 --> 00:19:59.910
Good luck.

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:01.800
You did it too.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.430
Kotoko?

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:10.180
Either way, I’m only living
with him temporarily.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:13.350
Please keep this a secret, okay?

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:14.450
Please.

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:15.590
Okay.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.050
Of course we will.

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.820
Aihara!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.530
Come with me!

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:35.100
Hey, you told me not to speak to you in school. Rumors will spread like this.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.420
Rumors have already spread!

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:43.250
What the hell is this?!

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:44.930
That’s what I would like to know.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:48.440
Those guys! I fervently told them to keep this secret too!

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.190
I’ve had it up to here!

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.150
Irie-kun.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:56.840
You may be okay with it,
but it’s a problem for me!

00:20:56.840 --> 00:21:00.490
Don’t mess with my life any more!

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:06.230
What’s with me?

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:12.070
No matter how much he bullies me... I hate him after all.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:14.340
I’m already fine with it.

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:16.040
I should be fine with it.

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:20.910
I was able to endure it when he refused my love letter.

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:24.050
But then, why do I...?

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:28.250
I guess...

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:32.350
...I really do love Irie-kun.

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.850
Oh, my. Kotoko-chan, what’s wrong? You look down.

00:23:09.850 --> 00:23:12.240
Oba-sama... Nevermind, it’s nothing.

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:13.450
Are you really all right?

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:16.490
You’re still young. You have to think more fun thoughts.

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:18.710
The sports meet is this Sunday, right? What are you in?

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:19.580
Boy-girl mixed relay.

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:21.570
Together with Onii-chan?

00:23:21.570 --> 00:23:23.890
How wonderful! I must buy
a new digital camera!

00:23:23.890 --> 00:23:25.720
I’m all fired up!

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:27.340
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:29.410
Romantic Baton Touch
Romantic baton touch.

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:31.550
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
Romantic Baton Touch

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:35.560
Romantic Baton Touch
